        "content": "import pytest\nfrom pydantic import ValidationError\nfrom pipeline.schema import SurvivorshipRule, rule_specificity, StartRunResponse\n\ndef test_prefer_source_requires_preferred_source_id():\n    with pytest.raises(ValidationError):\n        SurvivorshipRule(id=\"r1\", field=\"*\", entity_type=\"*\",\n                          strategy=\"prefer_source\", description=\"x\")\n\ndef test_prefer_source_with_id_is_valid():\n    rule = SurvivorshipRule(id=\"r1\", field=\"*\", entity_type=\"*\", strategy=\"prefer_source\",\n                             preferred_source_id=\"src-a\", description=\"x\")\n    assert rule.preferred_source_id == \"src-a\"\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"field,entity_type,expected\", [\n    (\"*\", \"*\", 0), (\"territory\", \"*\", 2), (\"*\", \"account\", 1), (\"territory\", \"account\", 3),\n])\ndef test_rule_specificity_ordering(field, entity_type, expected):\n    rule = SurvivorshipRule(id=\"r\", field=field, entity_type=entity_type,\n                             strategy=\"escalate\", description=\"x\")\n    assert rule_specificity(rule) == expected\n\ndef test_canon_model_camelcase_wire_format():\n    # AGENTS.md contract: wire format is camelCase, Python stays snake_case\n    resp = StartRunResponse(run_id=\"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\")\n    assert resp.model_dump(by_alias=True) == {\n        \"runId\": \"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\", \"accepted\": True\n    }\n\ndef test_canon_model_rejects_unknown_fields():\n    # extra=\"forbid\" — a payload with a typo'd/extra key must fail loudly, not silently drop it\n    with pytest.raises(ValidationError):\n        StartRunResponse(run_id=\"1\"*8 + \"-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\", extraField=\"x\")\n```\n\n```python\n",
