st proves the graph escalates instead when validate fails.\n        resolutions = resolve([conflict], rules=[])\n        assert resolutions[0].status == \"escalated\"\n        assert resolutions[0].proposed_value in (conflict.value_a, conflict.value_b)\n\n    def test_auto_apply_gate_and_validate_both_required(self):\n        # high confidence + low severity + validate FAILS → must still escalate,\n        # not auto-apply. Regression test for accidentally short-circuiting the gate.\n        ...\n```\n\n```python\n",
